[{"client_msg_id":"e26d8334-2a17-45df-b85b-ddb481666d63","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"```\t\t\t\t\t\t*\u0026lt;Cmd\u0026gt;* *:map-cmd*\nThe \u0026lt;Cmd\u0026gt; pseudokey begins a \"command mapping\", which executes the command\ndirectly (without changing modes).  Where you might use \":...\u0026lt;CR\u0026gt;\" in the\n{rhs} of a mapping, you can instead use \"\u0026lt;Cmd\u0026gt;...\u0026lt;CR\u0026gt;\".\nExample: \u0026gt;\n\tnoremap x \u0026lt;Cmd\u0026gt;echo mode(1)\u0026lt;cr\u0026gt;```","ts":"1626879598.189300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lAk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1bc501c8-22a2-43df-84bd-3c55da5d0011","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"neovim がむしろ `\u0026lt;cmd\u0026gt;` 先に入ってた気が","ts":"1626879588.189000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U776661HA"]},{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["UL6CFN8NR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kT/+H"}]},{"client_msg_id":"089230d3-bccb-4bc8-860e-66ef3baeea2f","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"neovimには \u0026lt;cmd\u0026gt; ない気が…","ts":"1626879569.188600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"totemoturai","count":1,"users":["U776661HA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7=ggZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"43a53e8b-f020-4635-917e-5d1e2eb4743f","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"最近の vim だと `\u0026lt;cmd\u0026gt;` がこういうときに使えるんでしたっけ。。。","ts":"1626879552.188200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["U776661HA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4aSWF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8c134066-1669-4a51-8a95-74178e3c5ec1","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":":bow:","ts":"1626879540.188000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"ty